WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:20.336
The stars faded and the sun rose.

2
00:00:20.337 --> 00:00:25.298
The dew sparkled on the grass.

3
00:00:25.299 --> 00:00:31.141
"Good morning," said Rat, waking.

4
00:00:31.142 --> 00:00:34.765
"Good morning," said Mole.

5
00:00:34.766 --> 00:00:39.808
Toad was still sleeping and snoring.

6
00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:45.370
"Well," said Rat, "there are chores to do."

7
00:00:45.371 --> 00:00:50.667
Mole fed the horse and Rat got the dishes out.

8
00:00:50.668 --> 00:00:55.538
Together they collected firewood.

9
00:00:55.539 --> 00:01:00.648
Rat started a fire and Mole cooked breakfast.

10
00:01:00.649 --> 00:01:05.074
Finally the smell of coffee woke Toad.

11
00:01:05.075 --> 00:01:09.036
"Ah," said Toad, stretching.

12
00:01:09.037 --> 00:01:11.561
"Isn't it great?

13
00:01:11.562 --> 00:01:16.155
There are no chores to do on the road!"

14
00:01:16.156 --> 00:01:21.338
"That's true for people who sleep too late," grumbled Rat.

15
00:01:21.339 --> 00:01:24.526
But Toad didn't hear him.

16
00:01:24.527 --> 00:01:29.418
He was too busy eating.

17
00:01:29.419 --> 00:01:35.827
"I'm ready. Let's go!" cried Toad after breakfast.

18
00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:38.942
Mole and Rat got into the cart.

19
00:01:38.943 --> 00:01:44.154
Toad tied the horse to the cart, and they started off.

20
00:01:44.155 --> 00:01:47.977
The dusty road led through a meadow.

21
00:01:47.978 --> 00:01:52.562
"Do you hear that noise?" asked Toad.

22
00:01:52.563 --> 00:01:56.305
"It's coming from behind us," said Mole.

23
00:01:56.306 --> 00:01:59.106
They all looked.

24
00:01:59.107 --> 00:02:04.478
A cloud of dust was coming up fast.

25
00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:07.100
Vroom! Vroom!

26
00:02:07.101 --> 00:02:11.345
"Oh no!" cried Rat. "Look out!"

27
00:02:11.346 --> 00:02:15.135
A blast of wind zoomed past.

28
00:02:15.136 --> 00:02:18.814
Vroom! Vroom!

29
00:02:18.815 --> 00:02:24.963
"Ahh!" they screamed.

30
00:02:24.964 --> 00:02:30.834
The cart tipped and fell over into a ditch.

31
00:02:30.835 --> 00:02:33.031
The dust cleared.

32
00:02:33.032 --> 00:02:41.860
Ahead, a big, beautiful car raced down the road!
